      "entryId": "2026-10-14-daily-news-1",
      "headline": "Dyping Working: 作業監視ゲーム announced for Steam in 2027",
      "summary": "PLAYISM announced Dyping Working: 作業監視ゲーム, a Dyping spin-off from Heaviside Creations in which an on-screen eye monitors the player’s work. It is planned for PC via Steam in 2027.",
      "verification": "Two opened media reports independently match on the developer, platform, and 2027 release window; one reproduces PLAYISM’s announcement text.",
      "timeNote": "Announced October 13, 2026; planned for 2027",
      "releaseTypeLabel": "Announcement",
      "sourceLabels": [
